    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Help Chhama find his grandson. </h2><br>Old man Chhama has lost his grandson. Can you help him escape from the perils of his enemies? <br>The only power available is slowing down (UNRUSH).<br>UNRUSH and pass through tricky pathways, fight bosses and solve puzzles to unfold the mystery!<br><br><br><strong>UNRUSH is a Solo Developed and Designed 2-D puzzle precision platformer.</strong><br>The objective of the game is to solve puzzles, fight bosses and pass through tricky pathways in order to proceed.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as old man Chhama and his grandson.<br></li><li>Slow down the protagonist to solve puzzles and proceed in the game.<br></li><li>35 levels, each level containing multiple puzzles.<br></li><li>The puzzles range from easy to hard and require critical thinking.<br></li><li>Hand-crafted Artwork<br></li><li>Original soundtracks that set the mood<br></li><li>The game has almost no text and can be enjoyed by players of all languages.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Help Chhama find his grandson. </h2><br>Old man Chhama has lost his grandson. Can you help him escape from the perils of his enemies? <br>The only power available is slowing down (UNRUSH).<br>UNRUSH and pass through tricky pathways, fight bosses and solve puzzles to unfold the mystery!<br><br><br><strong>UNRUSH is a Solo Developed and Designed 2-D puzzle precision platformer.</strong><br>The objective of the game is to solve puzzles, fight bosses and pass through tricky pathways in order to proceed.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as old man Chhama and his grandson.<br></li><li>Slow down the protagonist to solve puzzles and proceed in the game.<br></li><li>35 levels, each level containing multiple puzzles.<br></li><li>The puzzles range from easy to hard and require critical thinking.<br></li><li>Hand-crafted Artwork<br></li><li>Original soundtracks that set the mood<br></li><li>The game has almost no text and can be enjoyed by players of all languages.</li></ul>",
